title: September 11th 2001
subtitle: A terrorist attack on the americans.
on-arrival: resources += 0
tags: event
view-if: year = 2000 and month = 5
priority: 1
max-visits: 1

The Twin Towers of the World Trade Center, The Pentagon, and The U.S Capitol have been hit by hijacked american commercial airplanes.
Several organizations have work together to identify the attackers, the attackers were a part of a terrorist group called "Al-Qaeda" led by Osama bin Laden.
With the ever growing reach of the O5 Council they have also identified that the Chaos Insurgents are also involved in this attack, for reasons yet to be identified.

- @mourn: May those who passed away because of this tragic event rest in peace.

@mourn
on-arrival: exposure -= 30; chaos_insurgency += 15; chaos_insurgency_strength += 0.1;

